---
---

<section class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-32 bg-background">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      {/* Eyebrow */}
      <div class="mb-8">
        <span class="inline-block text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">
          The Principles
        </span>
      </div>

      {/* Section Heading */}
      <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8 leading-tight">
        Different perspectives. One connected system.
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-16">
        A technical object can be understood in different ways depending on what you need to know about it.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg text-foreground font-medium mb-16 leading-relaxed">
        RDS 81346 uses an aspect-oriented approach to describe systems from multiple perspectives while
        maintaining a consistent method of identification.
      </p>

      {/* Aspects Grid */}
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 lg:gap-16 mb-16">
        {/* Function Aspect */}
        <div class="flex flex-col space-y-4">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">Function aspect</h3>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            <strong>What does it do?</strong>
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Understand systems through the functions they perform, independently of how those functions are
            physically realized.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* Product Aspect */}
        <div class="flex flex-col space-y-4">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">Product aspect</h3>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            <strong>How is it realized?</strong>
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Describe the physical or logical products and components that make up a technical system.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* Location Aspect */}
        <div class="flex flex-col space-y-4">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">Location aspect</h3>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            <strong>Where is it located?</strong>
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Organize objects according to their spatial placement, making it easier to navigate facilities
            and locate equipment.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Closing Statement */}
      <div class="border-t border-border pt-12">
        <p class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">
          One system. Multiple perspectives. A shared understanding.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
